			"notes": "* Add support for Defiled Lands' biomes in non-Release Modern Beta worlds, which can be toggled and adjusted on a per-biome basis under the Add-on tab.\n* Improve biome distribution for modded biome support (e.g. Thaumcraft, Buildcraft Energy, Defiled Lands). Worlds created before this version will maintain the previous distribution.\n* Add biome locator function to map preview screen, which will give the approximate distance of a selected biome to 0/0 if nearby (within 2560 blocks). This is to help players check if desired biomes are nearby without giving away explicit coordinates (so you'll still need to explore!).\n* Improve error logging.\n* Fix springs not being able to generate in non-Stone default blocks.\n* Fix more minor GUI bugs."
		},
