			"notes": "* Add partial compatibility with Cubic Chunks. When installed, the normal 'Modern Beta' world type will be replaced by the 'Cubic Beta' world type on the Create New World screen. For performance reasons, world height minimum and maximum limits are limited to -1024 and 1024, respectively.\n* Improve vegetation feature density on taller worlds.\n* Improve data fixer error logging.\n* Fix surface builder not correctly generating bedrock for non-Release surface builders."
		},
